'''My Very Best Friend''' (最高の友達, ''Saikō no Tomodachi'', '''My Very Best Friend''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

==Effect==
"Witch Killer" Effect UP (XL): Increases the effect of the [[Witch Killer]] ability. [[:Category:Witch Killer Cats|Witch Killers]] now inflict 25x damage and only receive 1/50 as much damage from [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witches]].

