}}

==Trivia==
*The name of the Combo is a reference to the title of the final episode of the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event|Puella Magi Madoka Magica]] series: "My Very Best Friend".
*My Very Best Friend is the only "Witch Killer" Effect UP [[Cat Combo|Combo]] in the game and is the first ever Combo to have XL effect.

